~ convo_1
Fenn: Hey Mister Wizard, do you like ice cream?
Winston: Oh woooow. Asking the cold guy if he likes ice cream. Very original.
Fenn: Well... do you?
Winston: Wha- NO!!
Winston: It makes a mockery of nature. An insult to everything which is cold.
Fenn: Are- are you lactose intolerant?
Winston: And there you go! Assuming I'm lactose intolerant just because I don't like ice cream!
Fenn: Well, are you?
Winston: That's besides the point!
=> END

~ convo_2
